{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a turn-based combat game where you have to fight against the demons of Bebshoru Lodbuka's hell until you reach the deepest caverns where the supreme darkness of Trekim Gogzokk dwells. In each of the 30 levels you will fight a guardian demon until you reach the final fight. <br>In the fights you use cards that you can buy in the Marketplace and then throw them when you are fighting. These cards can have effects on your enemy and also on yourself. <br>There are 5 difficulty levels, and you can save your avatar at any time in addition to the current game, so you can start a new game with your previous avatar to not lose the evolution.<br>To play you have to use the mouse mainly except in the Marketplace where you can optionally use the Enter key on an item for sale to select how many units you want.<br>When you choose a higher difficulty level you won't be able to win unless you do some better combat strategy, but at easier levels you can relax a bit.<br>You have about 500 cards to buy and you are given more coins each time you pass a level.<br>Death is permanent, so don't forget to save the game if you want to play it again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492200?t=1743503479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492200?t=1743503479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492200/e83fd847c95747f86d5a3753aa1571c8cdb679cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743503479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492200/e83fd847c95747f86d5a3753aa1571c8cdb679cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743503479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a turn-based combat game where you have to fight against the demons of Bebshoru Lodbuka's hell until you reach the deepest caverns where the supreme darkness of Trekim Gogzokk dwells. In each of the 30 levels you will fight a guardian demon until you reach the final fight. <br>In the fights you use cards that you can buy in the Marketplace and then throw them when you are fighting. These cards can have effects on your enemy and also on yourself. <br>There are 5 difficulty levels, and you can save your avatar at any time in addition to the current game, so you can start a new game with your previous avatar to not lose the evolution.<br>To play you have to use the mouse mainly except in the Marketplace where you can optionally use the Enter key on an item for sale to select how many units you want.<br>When you choose a higher difficulty level you won't be able to win unless you do some better combat strategy, but at easier levels you can relax a bit.<br>You have about 500 cards to buy and you are given more coins each time you pass a level.<br>Death is permanent, so don't forget to save the game if you want to play it again.</p>","developers":["Game Factory 12 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492200/8b0199fca7d44718094be8105af032d7ff8fc025/header.jpg?t=1743503479","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120597,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120597/movie480.mp4?t=1743503475","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120597/movie_max.mp4?t=1743503475"},"name":"Bebshoru Lodbuka","thumbnail":"https:/